flowchart LR
    Trigger["Trigger<br/>one poll, from outside the model"]
    Action["Action<br/>one scoped job, done by the worker"]
    Verify["Verify<br/>a checker that is not the worker"]
    Memory["Memory<br/>files a later process can read"]
    Exit["Exit<br/>pass, retry, or escalate"]

    Trigger --> Action --> Verify --> Exit
    Action --> Memory
    Verify --> Memory
    Exit -->|retry, same run| Action
    Memory -.->|restore point| Trigger
